# Per-target folders hold engagement data (scope, policy, traffic logs, recon,
# findings, reports, session material) and are never committed.
# Ignore every top-level folder except the shared workflow ones.
/*/
!/_template/
!/bin/
!/.claude/
*/work/
*/reports/
*/policy_raw.md
!_template/**
# secrets
*.env
.env*
*credentials*
*.pem
*.key
*.har
*.jsonl
